--- 2. GREEDY URGENCY PRIORITISATION ---------------------------
  urgency = 100 * (0.60 * normalised_fill + 0.40 * normalised_age)

  Rank  Bin               Zone   Fill(t)  Age(h)   Urgency
  --------------------------------------------------------
  1     A                    1      4.00    10.0     100.0
  2     B                    1      4.00     9.0      96.0

--- 3. CAPACITY-AWARE SELECTION & ROUTING (per truck) ----------

  Truck Truck_A   (capacity 8.0 t, shift 120 min, start Depot)
    DP knapsack picked 2 bin(s)  ->  load 8.00 t / 8.00 t,   urgency value 196.0
        - A               4.00 t   urgency 100.0
        - B               4.00 t   urgency  96.0
    Route: Depot -> Transfer_A -> Transfer_B -> Transfer_B -> Depot
      Depot          -> Transfer_A        2.0 min   [Depot -> Transfer_A]
      Transfer_A     -> Transfer_B        1.0 min   [Transfer_A -> Transfer_B]
      Transfer_B     -> Transfer_B        0.0 min   [Transfer_B]
      Transfer_B     -> Depot             3.0 min   [Transfer_B -> Depot]
    Travel 6.0 min + service 12.0 min = 18.0 min  (shift 120 min)  OK
    Tipped 8.00 t at Transfer_B   (station now at 8.00 / 20.00 t/day)

